# Production build env. This site takes no build-time config of its own —
# PUBLIC_VERSION / PUBLIC_RELEASED_AT are exported into the build environment by
# release-sveltekit (process env beats .env files), and .env holds their empty
# defaults so non-release builds compile.
#
# The file must still exist: release-sveltekit hard-fails without it, and Vite
# loads it for the production-mode build. Do not delete it.
